From c52198060edcd6ef65b36c8d51908ac1afde012f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 09:45:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Audit: fix mobile layout overflow, calculator validation,
 admin styles, pin deps

Frontend
- Rewrite style.css without !important layers; header is a flex row where
  brand shrinks (min-width:0) and ONLINE is flex:none, full-bleed sticky bar.
- Fix horizontal page overflow on Promotions/Admin (long unbroken text,
  missing min-width:0 / overflow-wrap) at 320-430px.
- Restore admin promo management styles removed in c3f1789.
- Self-host Manrope/DM Sans (Cyrillic) with real fallbacks; add viewport-fit=cover
  so env(safe-area-inset-*) works; 100dvh; 16px inputs.
- Calculator: sanitize input, min 5 USDT (both directions), max 10,000,000,
  no NaN, swap is a real button, rates are not hardcoded before load.
- Guard double clicks (add/delete promo, refresh, save rates); handle 422
  detail arrays; Telegram BackButton, showConfirm, openTelegramLink.
- Typed state (no any), pin dependency versions, add lockfile, .gitignore,
  vite.config.ts, engines.

Backend
- Enforce minimum 5 USDT for UAH->USDT in /api/orders.
- Constant-time webhook secret comparison (bytes).
- Ukrainian error messages.
